{"reviewId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "​​“第一阶段”的核心是​​“宽松—美元贬值—逆差缓和—但信心受损”​​。\n宽松政策虽然让经济放缓的脚步变慢，但美元贬值带来的资本流向波动和信心问题，又使得真正的复苏迟迟难以启动，最终表现为美国经济在衰退与复苏之间徘徊的时间被显著拉长。\n\n贬值的短期“好处”与长期“副作用”​​\n• ​​短期​​：美元走弱提升美国出口竞争力，帮助缓解贸易逆差，也让以美元计价的进口资源品价格回落，减轻通胀压力。\n• ​​长期​​：美元贬值预期加剧资本外流与美元回流的不确定性，削弱美元作为全球储备货币的信誉；市场对美国资产质量的担忧抬升避险需求，导致美元在后续阶段反而走强或波动加剧。结果是美国经济复苏被“拖长”——衰退—修复—再放缓的V型或L型时间被拉长。 ​​", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "第一阶段，美联储通过放松货币政策以延缓经济增长步入衰退的速度。", "range": "17651-17682", "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj", "userVid": 14755045, "topics": [], "createTime": 1770531747, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 14755045, "name": "宣竞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eribDf5WbXhckyg2M2mb40M8BxVy6hmycicsKI8utaeYLiaNlHia20fGHzF0Pw2hsibrvZQ0k3rzHMaKjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "仁者如射，射者正己而后发；发而不中，不怨胜己者，反求诸己而已", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 259153360, "name": "十八°", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/9rbfnVicX3WUZz3nGMicFic2Wp0yticks1oAhdjsGDKDicRGgpZrqYkaUE7iaibGONEdJ1ic2ygo4EDvxOk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "十八°", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "一本时差被打断的书", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj", "content": "资产暴跌——恐慌中美元反而“成神”了\n这是最反直觉的一步。当资本流出导致美国资产价格（比如科技股、商业地产）开始暴跌时，全球金融市场会瞬间进入“恐慌模式”。\n\n市场的第一反应：不是去兑换黄金，而是意识到“哪哪都不安全了！”。这时候，全球的银行、对冲基金、跨国企业突然发现，自己背着一大堆美元债务。资产暴跌意味着抵押品缩水，银行要催债。\n\n为了还债和补仓（去杠杆）：所有机构都在疯抢美元现金来填窟窿。这时候，美元反而因为“全球最大的债务结算货币”这一身份，被恐慌性挤兑了。\n结果：即便美国经济很差，美元指数反而因避险“美元荒”逆势走强，或者变得上蹿下跳（波动加剧）。", "commentId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj_c282892689_8asYdJIXA", "userVid": 282892689, "createTime": 1783582568, "author": {"userVid": 282892689, "name": "施宇峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKS3YoCdhDRwKYIVhkXc2BKCa4ZibG5prZpdkoW5V5My8UcKmjbTSQ1ja6gy7SN9PqiaCwODqLgrNdg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"content": "同问，后期不是导致美元走弱吗", "reviewId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj", "commentId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj_c514007366_8a3C8ySyt", "userVid": 514007366, "createTime": 1782142331, "author": {"userVid": 514007366, "name": "今我来思", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-8rSNVXQRP5y5l4njbfNP510/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "今我来思", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230109-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "为什么市场去美国资产避险，反而后期导致美元走强呢？不解", "reviewId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj", "commentId": "14755045_86LcFeAbj_c259153360_86VyRjyzR", "userVid": 259153360, "createTime": 1771120082, "author": {"userVid": 259153360, "name": "十八°", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/9rbfnVicX3WUZz3nGMicFic2Wp0yticks1oAhdjsGDKDicRGgpZrqYkaUE7iaibGONEdJ1ic2ygo4EDvxOk/0", "isFollowing": 0